Removed before the first EUPL release
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- kernel/tty/font8x16.h: matched the Linux kernel's GPL-2.0 font_8x16.c. Unused;
  deleted. Spleen (above) is the console font.
- doomgeneric/: GPL-2.0-or-later (one file GPL-3.0-or-later). Not part of the
  kernel; moved out of this tree.
- drivers/net/bcmgenet.c (Raspberry Pi 4 Ethernet): its own header named GPL
  drivers as its documentation, and a similarity scan found the structure of
  U-Boot's GPL-2.0+ driver in it. Withdrawn pending a clean rewrite.
- arch/aarch64/linker_raspi4.ld and vdso/vdso_layout.lds were rewritten from
  scratch; the old raspi4 script carried lines from the MIT-licensed
  raspi3-tutorial (Copyright bzt). Output is byte-identical.

Older Ranix code published elsewhere (github.com/RasifoX/ranix, and the ranix.org
text that called it "GPLv2") is not covered by this notice.
